WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.500
It's her birthday.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Not a customer's emergency.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Right now, you're crouched down,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.100
ready to help her blow out the candles.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.400
And somewhere, a phone lights up.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.700
But you don't reach for it.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.000
Because Eava is already on it,

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.600
twenty-four seven, answering, booking,

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.500
following up, running the front

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.000
of your business like a real employee would.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.300
So you get to actually enjoy

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.900
the things you deserve.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:26.900
Eava.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.400
Your all-around AI employee,

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.100
working while you live your life.
